    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of UGOMEKU NOTE</strong><br>(\u201cWriggling Note\u201d)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2014gentle, kind, and always wearing a lovely smile\u2014<br>have been chosen as a hero to embark on an adventure full of humor and heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a handcrafted RPG made with RPG Maker MV.<br>All graphics, music, and systems are being created by a solo developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wonderful world awaits</strong><br>Colorful and quirky characters!<br>A world overflowing with originality!<br>A story so moving... it <i>might</i> make all of America cry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm \u00d7 Action?! A thrilling battle system!</strong><br>Attack in time with the beat!<br>Defend with perfect timing against enemy strikes!<br>Only <strong>UGOMEKU NOTE</strong> offers this unique battle experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A message hidden in the notebook</strong><br>A boy\u2019s story unfolds through the pages of a notebook.<br>Does it carry a deeper meaning\u2026 or not?<br>Look closely\u2014and decide for yourself.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of UGOMEKU NOTE</strong><br>(\u201cWriggling Note\u201d)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2014gentle, kind, and always wearing a lovely smile\u2014<br>have been chosen as a hero to embark on an adventure full of humor and heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a handcrafted RPG made with RPG Maker MV.<br>All graphics, music, and systems are being created by a solo developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wonderful world awaits</strong><br>Colorful and quirky characters!<br>A world overflowing with originality!<br>A story so moving... it <i>might</i> make all of America cry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm \u00d7 Action?! A thrilling battle system!</strong><br>Attack in time with the beat!<br>Defend with perfect timing against enemy strikes!<br>Only <strong>UGOMEKU NOTE</strong> offers this unique battle experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A message hidden in the notebook</strong><br>A boy\u2019s story unfolds through the pages of a notebook.<br>Does it carry a deeper meaning\u2026 or not?<br>Look closely\u2014and decide for yourself.</p>",
